<%# The chat, a key piece of the game (decision), an island at the bottom right (maquette C): low by default, so that
    the board keeps the screen, its height changed by the handle at its top (dragged, or the arrow keys once it has the
    focus) and folded by its button, both kept in this browser (chat_island_controller.js; the handle and the button
    rendered hidden and shown by it; the handle lies over the top of the header, which keeps its height). Folded, 60 px high like the other islands (its header 58 px inside its
    border). Its feed (ChatMessage): the last lines of the table, then those sent live by GameTableChannel, messages
    typed at the table and events written by the server (an item given), then the field to write. A line that comes
    while the chat is folded counts as unread: a gold round in the header with their number, a « Nouveaux messages »
    line before the first one once unfolded; while the reader is further up, a pill takes them down to it
    (chat_feed_controller.js). From 1024 px: on a
    smaller screen it will need a place of its own. « Afficher le chat » (Paramètres › Affichage) hides it altogether %>
<aside class="<%= GameRoomHelper::ISLAND_CLASSES %> absolute right-4 bottom-4 z-20 hidden w-80 flex-col lg:flex"
       aria-labelledby="game-room-chat-title" data-controller="chat-island chat-feed"
       data-action="game-room-chat:change@window->chat-island#showOrHide chat-island:folded->chat-feed#foldChanged"
       data-chat-island-fold-label-value="<%= t(".fold") %>" data-chat-island-unfold-label-value="<%= t(".unfold") %>"
       data-chat-feed-current-user-id-value="<%= current_user.id %>"
       data-chat-feed-table-id-value="<%= game_room.game_table.id %>"
       data-chat-feed-unread-one-value="<%= t(".unread.one") %>"
       data-chat-feed-unread-other-value="<%= t(".unread.other") %>">
  <div hidden role="separator" tabindex="0" aria-orientation="horizontal" aria-controls="game-room-chat-body"
       aria-label="<%= t(".resize") %>" title="<%= t(".resize") %>"
       class="group absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-10 flex h-3 cursor-ns-resize touch-none items-center justify-center rounded-t-xl focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring"
       data-chat-island-target="handle"
       data-action="pointerdown->chat-island#startResize keydown->chat-island#resizeWithKeys">
    <span class="h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-line transition-colors group-hover:bg-field-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>
  <header class="flex h-[58px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-4">
    <%= render "shared/icons/message_square_text", css_class: "size-5 text-muted" %>
    <h2 id="game-room-chat-title" class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink"><%= t(".title") %></h2>
    <span hidden class="<%= GameRoomChatHelper::UNREAD_BADGE_CLASSES %>" aria-hidden="true"
          data-chat-feed-target="badge"></span>
    <span id="game-room-chat-unread" class="sr-only" data-chat-feed-target="unreadText"></span>
    <button type="button" hidden class="<%= button_classes(:quiet, size: :compact_icon) %> group/fold ml-auto"
            aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="game-room-chat-body" aria-label="<%= t(".fold") %>"
            aria-describedby="game-room-chat-unread"
            title="<%= t(".fold") %>" data-chat-island-target="toggle" data-action="chat-island#toggle">
      <%= render "shared/icons/chevron_down", css_class: "size-4 transition-transform group-aria-[expanded=false]/fold:rotate-180" %>
    </button>
  </header>
  <div id="game-room-chat-body" class="flex h-64 flex-col border-t border-line" data-chat-island-target="body">
    <%= game_table_stream_from(game_room.game_table) %>
    <div class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col">
      <div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 py-3" data-chat-feed-target="scroller"
           data-action="scroll->chat-feed#scrolled">
        <p class="text-sm text-muted [&:has(+ol>li)]:hidden"><%= t(".empty") %></p>
        <ol id="<%= ChatMessage::FEED_TARGET %>" class="space-y-3" role="log" aria-labelledby="game-room-chat-title">
          <%= render partial: "game_rooms/chat_line", collection: game_room.chat_feed, as: :line %>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <button type="button" hidden class="<%= GameRoomChatHelper::NEW_MESSAGES_BUTTON_CLASSES %>"
              data-chat-feed-target="newMessagesButton" data-action="chat-feed#readNewMessages">
        <%= t(".new_messages") %>
        <%= render "shared/icons/chevron_down", css_class: "size-3.5" %>
      </button>
    </div>
    <template data-chat-feed-target="dividerTemplate">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-brass uppercase"
          data-chat-divider>
        <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-brass/50" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <%= t(".new_messages") %>
        <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-brass/50" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </li>
    </template>
    <%= render "game_rooms/chat_form", game_table: game_room.game_table %>
  </div>
</aside>
